+/// Scaling applied before a generated direct kernel stores one complex output.
+///
+/// This is orthogonal to destination accumulation. Recurrence applications
+/// retain their authenticated exact factor; fused compiled stages overwrite
+/// distinct planes with an identity scale.
+#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Eq, PartialEq)]
